\"Scoped proposition explains or qualifies this concept; support remains limited to the exact original evidence note.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:adjustment-design\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[\"Interpret the relation within the stated design, population and observation process.\"],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[\"This editorial link does not certify semantic entailment or implementation correctness.\"],\"id\":\"relation:f266f74dde329370eedf7abd\",\"object_id\":\"concept:missing-data\",\"predicate\":\"related_to\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-ontology\",\"source:ontology:pearl2009\",\"source:ontology:imai2010\",\"bang2005\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original explanation and primary reference context; not a completed implementation audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped proposition explains or qualifies this concept; support remains limited to the exact original evidence note.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:adjustment-design\"}],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original note reviewed against linked primary context; no external full text redistributed.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"sources\":[\"source:ontology:pearl2009\",\"source:ontology:imai2010\",\"bang2005\"],\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped original methodological explanation; no whole-method or study audit is implied.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:note:adjustment-design\",\"source:ontology:pearl2009\",\"source:ontology:imai2010\",\"bang2005\"],\"summary\":\"A variable can predict outcomes and still be inappropriate for adjustment. Conditioning on a mediator can remove part of a total effect; conditioning on a collider can open a noncausal path. Choose the adjustment set using the stated causal graph and pre-treatment measurement timing. Complete-case restrictions and missing-data procedures also need explicit assumptions and may change which population the comparison represents.\",\"title\":\"Adjustment depends on causal role and timing\"}" .
<urn:capy:claim%3Aaft-heterogeneity> a capy:claim ; skos:prefLabel "AFT interactions and marginal effect modification are different tests" ; prov:wasDerivedFrom <urn:capy:source%3Anote%3Aaft-heterogeneity> ; capy:record "{\"aliases\":[\"AFT interaction\",\"AFT heterogeneity\",\"time factor heterogeneity\",\"accelerated failure time subgroup\"],\"assertion_mode\":\"original_editorial_explanation\",\"citation_ids\":[\"source:note:aft-heterogeneity\",\"source:ontology:kent2020\",\"source:ontology:r-survreg\",\"source:ontology:wei1992\"],\"citations\":[],\"conditions\":[\"Common residual scale and distribution, correct likelihood and appropriate observation conditions.\",\"Treatment and modifier coding and target subgroup population are explicit.\"],\"counterevidence\":[\"The algebraic conditional time factor is not an individual causal effect or a finite-horizon RMST ratio.\"],\"evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:aft-heterogeneity\"],\"gaps\":[\"This scoped methodological note does not validate a particular study or certify the local statistical implementation.\"],\"id\":\"claim:aft-heterogeneity\",\"kind\":\"claim\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:aft-heterogeneity\"],\"relations\":[{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:33668f895910f23bb5a444da\",\"object_id\":\"source:ontology:kent2020\",\"predicate\":\"cites\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:aft-heterogeneity\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"pe