VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Citation and original explanation; linked external bodies are not included.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:cate-heterogeneity-evaluation\"}],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped methodological explanation; not a study finding or a promise of identification.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:note:cate-heterogeneity-evaluation\",\"source:ontology:genericml\",\"source:ontology:grf-blp\",\"source:ontology:grf-calibration\"],\"summary\":\"A CATE is a conditional average contrast, not an observed individual treatment effect. BLP summarizes it through specified features, calibration evaluates learned predictions, and GATES summarizes groups induced by a learned score. Keep their estimands and nulls distinct. Formal guarantees require the stated score construction, independence or sample-splitting and covariance procedure; plotting bins or regressing fitted predictions does not by itself implement the published estimator. Report simplifications of the local adapter and distinguish exploratory diagnostics from validated inference.\",\"title\":\"CATE projection, calibration and GATES require honest evaluation\"}" .
<urn:capy:claim%3Acategorical-outcome-interaction> a capy:claim ; skos:prefLabel "Categorical-outcome probability heterogeneity" ; prov:wasDerivedFrom <urn:capy:source%3Anote%3Acategorical-outcome-interaction> ; capy:record "{\"aliases\":[\"categorical heterogeneity\",\"nominal outcome\",\"ordinal outcome\",\"multinomial interaction\"],\"assertion_mode\":\"original_editorial_explanation\",\"citation_ids\":[\"source:note:categorical-outcome-interaction\",\"source:ontology:statsmodels-mnlogit\",\"source:ontology:statsmodels-wald\"],\"citations\":[],\"conditions\":[\"Sampling covariance and prediction target must match the declared null.\"],\"counterevidence\":[\"A conditional coefficient test does not automatically answer a different marginal probability or population target.\"],\"evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:categorical-outcome-interaction\"],\"gaps\":[\"This scoped methodological note does not validate a particular study or certify the local statistical implementation.\"],\"id\":\"claim:categorical-outcome-interaction\",\"kind\":\"claim\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:categorical-outcome-interaction\"],\"relations\":[{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:50cb9ff45703dba091c9e9a3\",\"object_id\":\"source:ontology:statsmodels-wald\",\"predicate\":\"cites\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:categorical-outcome-interaction\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache