; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped methodological explanation; not a study finding or a promise of identification.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:did-group-time-att\"}],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"engines/python/capy_py/did_modern.py\",\"tests/python/test_did_modern.py\",\"https://arxiv.org/html/1803.09015v4\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-12\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped methodological explanation; not a study finding or a promise of identification.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:note:did\",\"callaway2021\"],\"summary\":\"Staggered-adoption DiD separates cohort-time ATT(g,t) from overall, cohort and dynamic averages and uses eligible untreated comparisons for each cell.\",\"title\":\"Staggered DiD cohort-time ATT\"}" .
<urn:capy:claim%3Adid-no-anticipation> a capy:claim ; skos:prefLabel "DiD no anticipation and control eligibility" ; prov:wasDerivedFrom <urn:capy:source%3Anote%3Adid> ; capy:record "{\"aliases\":[\"anticipation window\",\"not yet treated\",\"no anticipation\"],\"assertion_mode\":\"original_editorial_explanation\",\"citation_ids\":[\"callaway2021\",\"source:note:did\"],\"citations\":[],\"conditions\":[\"The adoption date and intervention are well defined.\",\"Controls remain unaffected over the comparison periods.\",\"Any anticipation horizon is declared and implemented.\"],\"counterevidence\":[\"Non-significant leads do not prove no anticipation.\",\"Not-yet-treated status alone need not imply no treatment-related response.\"],\"evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:did-no-anticipation\"],\"gaps\":[\"The ordinary public engine adoption-date path does not establish support for every anticipation-window design.\"],\"id\":\"claim:did-no-anticipation\",\"kind\":\"claim\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:did\"],\"relations\":[{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[\"The adoption date and intervention are well defined.\",\"Controls remain unaffected over the comparison periods.\",\"Any anticipation horizon is declared and implemented.\"],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:bb85f5c167983310fced6f3b\",\"object_id\":\"did.callaway_santanna\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:did\",\"callaway2021\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"engines/python/capy_py/did_modern.py\",\"tests/python/test_did_modern.py\",\"https://arxiv.org/html/1803.09015v4\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-12\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true