inal methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped methodological explanation; not a study finding or a promise of identification.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:heterogeneity-prespecification\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[\"Observed modifier precedes treatment or has an explicitly justified alternative causal target.\"],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:fc2f141329901a7971f9b303\",\"object_id\":\"heterogeneity.continuous\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:heterogeneity-prespecification\",\"source:ontology:sun2010\",\"source:ontology:kent2020\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped methodological explanation; not a study finding or a promise of identification.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:heterogeneity-prespecification\"}],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped methodological explanation; not a study finding or a promise of identification.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:note:heterogeneity-prespecification\",\"source:ontology:sun2010\",\"source:ontology:kent2020\"],\"summary\":\"Define baseline modifiers and the family of hypotheses before looking for outcome patterns. Report all attempted modifiers, scales and horizons, with a multiplicity strategy or explicit exploratory status. Preserve main effects when adding treatment interactions. Baseline timing and prespecification declarations are study assertions to audit, not facts verified by a checkbox. Rejecting one omnibus null neither adjusts pointwise subgroup intervals nor establishes every subgroup difference.\",\"title\":\"Subgroup discovery and confirmatory analysis have different evidence requirements\"}" .
