":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Citation and original explanation; linked external bodies are not included.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:mediation-target\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[\"The mediator intervention and target-specific identifying assumptions are justified.\"],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:d3c33700e9f38ba6ec78cd5f\",\"object_id\":\"med.natural_effects\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:mediation-target\",\"source:ontology:imai2010\",\"source:ontology:vansteelandt2017\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original note reviewed against linked primary context; no external full text redistributed.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"sources\":[\"source:ontology:imai2010\",\"source:ontology:vansteelandt2017\"],\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped original methodological explanation; no whole-method or study audit is implied.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:mediation-target\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[\"Interpret the relation within the stated design, population and observation process.\"],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[\"This editorial link does not certify semantic entailment or implementation correctness.\"],\"id\":\"relation:e544a8e88028f98858a1543e\",\"object_id\":\"concept:interventional-effects\",\"predicate\":\"related_to\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-ontology\",\"source:ontology:imai2010\",\"source:ontology:vansteelandt2017\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original explanation and primary reference context; not a completed implementation audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped proposition explains or qualifies this concept; support remains limited to the exact original evidence note.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:mediation-target\"}],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original note reviewed against linked primary context; no external full text redistributed.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"sources\":[\"source:ontology:imai2010\",\"source:ontology:vansteelandt2017\"],\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped original methodological explanation; no whole-method or study audit is implied.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:note:mediation-target\",\"source:ontology:imai2010\",\"source:ontology:vansteelandt2017\"],\"summary\":\"Randomized treatment does not automatically identify mediator effects. A controlled direct effect fixes a mediator intervention, while natural effects involve mediator potential outcomes and additional cross-world or equivalent structural conditions. Interventional mediation effects specify different stochastic mediator strategies. Identify the target explicitly, inspect mediator-outcome confounding and exposure-induced confounders, and avoid relabeling a mediator-adjusted treatment regression coefficient as any of these effects without its identification argument.\",\"title\":\"Mediation targets require additional assumptions\"}" .
