l note reviewed against linked primary context; no external full text redistributed.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"sources\":[\"source:ontology:hudgens2008\",\"source:ontology:bareinboim2016\"],\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Citation and original explanation; linked external bodies are not included.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:population-effects\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[\"Exposure mapping or transport assumptions match the declared target.\"],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:fab70ab8ba173aa03af05648\",\"object_id\":\"transport.generalize\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:population-effects\",\"source:ontology:hudgens2008\",\"source:ontology:bareinboim2016\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original note reviewed against linked primary context; no external full text redistributed.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"sources\":[\"source:ontology:hudgens2008\",\"source:ontology:bareinboim2016\"],\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped original methodological explanation; no whole-method or study audit is implied.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:population-effects\"}],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original note reviewed against linked primary context; no external full text redistributed.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"sources\":[\"source:ontology:hudgens2008\",\"source:ontology:bareinboim2016\"],\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped original methodological explanation; no whole-method or study audit is implied.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:note:population-effects\",\"source:ontology:hudgens2008\",\"source:ontology:bareinboim2016\"],\"summary\":\"Cross-unit treatment effects require an exposure mapping or allocation strategy, so direct, spillover and overall effects can differ. Transport to another population additionally requires source and target definitions, relevant effect modifiers and support. A balancing weight or network summary alone does not establish the assumptions needed for either question. State which units, assignments and population distributions the reported effect averages over.\",\"title\":\"Interference and transport alter the comparison\"}" .
