tation audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped proposition explains or qualifies this concept; support remains limited to the exact original evidence note.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:survival-censoring\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:ef80534bf182491757e0721a\",\"object_id\":\"source:note:survival-censoring\",\"predicate\":\"cites\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:survival-censoring\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original note reviewed against linked primary context; no external full text redistributed.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"sources\":[\"source:ontology:cole2004\",\"source:ontology:wei1992\",\"source:ontology:r-survreg\"],\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Citation and original explanation; linked external bodies are not included.\",\"subject_id\":\"claim:survival-censoring\"}],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original note reviewed against linked primary context; no external full text redistributed.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"sources\":[\"source:ontology:cole2004\",\"source:ontology:wei1992\",\"source:ontology:r-survreg\"],\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Scoped original methodological explanation; no whole-method or study audit is implied.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:note:survival-censoring\",\"source:ontology:cole2004\",\"source:ontology:wei1992\",\"source:ontology:r-survreg\"],\"summary\":\"A right-censored record says the event occurs after the observed duration; it contributes a survival-tail term rather than an event density to a parametric likelihood. Raw treatment-arm Kaplan–Meier and its RMST summary need within-arm independent censoring and supported risk sets for their associational distributions. Conditional independence of censoring given additional measured covariates does not automatically justify raw arm curves when both censoring and event time depend on those covariates. A causal treatment contrast additionally needs a separate identification argument. Delayed entry, interval censoring and competing events require explicitly supported procedures.\",\"title\":\"Conditional censoring assumptions must match the procedure\"}" .
<urn:capy:claim%3Asurvival-heterogeneity> a capy:claim ; skos:prefLabel "KM and RMST heterogeneity depend on common horizons and subgroup support" ; prov:wasDerivedFrom <urn:capy:source%3Anote%3Asurvival-heterogeneity> ; capy:record "{\"aliases\":[\"survival heterogeneity\",\"KM subgroup test\",\"RMST interaction\",\"Kaplan Meier heterogeneity\"],\"assertion_mode\":\"original_editorial_explanation\",\"citation_ids\":[\"source:note:survival-heterogeneity\",\"source:ontology:altman2003\",\"source:ontology:cole2004\",\"source:ontology:uno2014\"],\"citations\":[],\"conditions\":[\"The same time units and horizon are supported in each required treatment-by-subgroup cell.\",\"Both treatment arms occur in every target subgroup.\"],\"counterevidence\":[\"Large total sample size does not guarantee within-subgroup treatment or censoring support.\"],\"evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:survival-heterogeneity\"],\"gaps\":[\"This scoped methodological note does not validate a particular study or certify the local statistical implementation.\"],\"id\":\"claim:survival-heterogeneity\",\"kind\":\"claim\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:survival-heterogeneity\"],\"relations\":[{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:16e01c5e077e1aef08d1d37f\",\"object_id\":\"source:ontology:uno2014\",\"predicate\":\"cites\",\"provenance\":[\"source:note:survival-heterogeneity\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_context_review\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"ad