 methodological context for Collider and collider bias; not a study finding or a complete review of every implementation.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:ontology:pearl2009\"],\"summary\":\"Conditioning on a common effect can open a previously blocked path and create selection bias, even when the variable predicts the outcome.\",\"title\":\"Collider and collider bias\"}" .
