ied conceptual navigation; related terms are not equivalent estimands or verified identifying conditions.\",\"subject_id\":\"concept:consistency\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:94be64735f325069213e95eb\",\"object_id\":\"source:ontology:rubin2008\",\"predicate\":\"cites\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-ontology\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original explanation and primary reference context; not a completed implementation audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Source context for original explanation; linked external bodies are not redistributed.\",\"subject_id\":\"concept:consistency\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:ff006583455f7e2d00d7b292\",\"object_id\":\"hernan2020\",\"predicate\":\"cites\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-ontology\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original explanation and primary reference context; not a completed implementation audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Source context for original explanation; linked external bodies are not redistributed.\",\"subject_id\":\"concept:consistency\"}],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original explanation and primary reference context; not a completed implementation audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-13\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Original methodological context for Consistency and treatment versions; not a study finding or a complete review of every implementation.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:ontology:rubin2008\",\"hernan2020\"],\"summary\":\"Observed and counterfactual outcomes agree for the received, adequately specified intervention; vague or incompatible treatment versions can break the comparison.\",\"title\":\"Consistency and treatment versions\"}" .
<urn:capy:concept%3Acontinuous-outcome-interaction> a capy:concept ; skos:prefLabel "Continuous-outcome mean interaction" ; prov:wasDerivedFrom <urn:capy:source%3Aproject-ontology> ; capy:ontologyRole "method_idea" ; capy:record "{\"aliases\":[\"continuous heterogeneity\",\"linear interaction\",\"robust Wald\"],\"assertion_mode\":\"original_editorial_context\",\"citation_ids\":[\"hernan2020\",\"source:ontology:statsmodels-wald\"],\"citations\":[],\"conditions\":[\"Interpret in the declared target population, sampling design and outcome scale.\"],\"counterevidence\":[\"A statistical heterogeneity signal does not establish causal identification.\"],\"evidence_basis\":\"Original project explanation with linked sources; not an exact reviewed claim/evidence group.\",\"gaps\":[\"Independent human review and study-specific assumption verification are absent.\"],\"id\":\"concept:continuous-outcome-interaction\",\"kind\":\"concept\",\"ontology_role\":\"method_idea\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-ontology\"],\"relations\":[{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[\"Interpret in the declared target population, sampling design and outcome scale.\"],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[\"Implementation availability must be checked in the registry.\"],\"id\":\"relation:69f96527b88d07b9a4f141bd\",\"object_id\":\"concept:effect-modification\",\"predicate\":\"broader\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-ontology\",\"source:ontology:statsmodels-wald\",\"hernan2020\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Qualified conceptual navigation, not an identifying assumption or equivalence.\",\"subject_id\":\"concept:continuous-outcome-interaction\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[\"Interpret in the declared target population, sampling design and outcome scale.\"],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:bd3ff6f322215c4bbd39dd95\",\"object_id\":\"hernan2020\",\"predicate\":\"cites\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-ontology\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Source context for original explanation; linked external bodies are not redistributed.\",\"subject_id\":\"concept:continuous-outcome-interaction\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[\"Interpret in the declared target population, sampling design and outcome scale.\"],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:f28b5a5acf859aeb1b4d90f5\",\"object_id\":\"source:ontology:statsmodels-wald\",\"predicate\":\"cites\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-ontology\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Source context for original explanation; linked external bodies are not redistributed.\",\"subject_id\":\"concept:continuous-outcome-interaction\"}],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Original scoped methodological guidance for Continuous-outcome mean interaction; not a completed study audit or universal method support.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:ontology:statsmodels-wald\",\"hernan2020\"],\"summary\":\"An identity-link treatment-by-modifier coefficient describes variation in a conditional mean difference. A robust covariance addresses specified sampling variance conditions, not misspecified causal adjustment or an unidentified target.\",\"title\":\"Continuous-outcome mean interaction\"}" .
