inal methodological context for Front-door identification; not a study finding or a complete review of every implementation.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:ontology:pearl2009\"],\"summary\":\"Mediator-based identification uses a specific graphical structure with additional conditions; ordinary mediator regression is not a generic substitute.\",\"title\":\"Front-door identification\"}" .
