iginal methodological context for Hazard ratio interpretation; not a study finding or a complete review of every implementation.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:ontology:hernan2010\"],\"summary\":\"A hazard ratio compares risk-set conditional rates and may vary over time; it is not a risk ratio or a marginal survival difference.\",\"title\":\"Hazard ratio interpretation\"}" .
