ial methodological context for this registry entry; not a reviewed implementation or equivalence assertion.\",\"subject_id\":\"its.arima\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:ff7ddeb39a6828eb711750d8\",\"object_id\":\"assumption:no_cointerventions\",\"predicate\":\"requires_assumption\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-inventory\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"date\":\"2026-10-12\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"not_assessed\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Declared project registry/navigation relationship; not an identified causal effect.\",\"subject_id\":\"its.arima\"}],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"date\":\"2026-10-12\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"not_assessed\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"summary\":\"Model the memory in the series itself, then ask how big a step, pulse or ramp the data need at the intervention date.\",\"title\":\"ARIMA with an intervention\"}" .
<urn:capy:its.causal_impact> a capy:method ; skos:prefLabel "Bayesian structural time series (CausalImpact)" ; prov:wasDerivedFrom <urn:capy:source%3Aproject-inventory> ; capy:record "{\"aliases\":[\"method:its.causal_impact\"],\"catalogue_key\":\"method:its.causal_impact\",\"citation_ids\":[\"10.1214/14-aoas788\"],\"citations\":[],\"content\":{\"availability\":{\"coming\":\"Not wrapped. Segmented regression with HAC errors, seasonality and control series is implemented, as is an ARIMA intervention model.\",\"engines\":{\"python\":false,\"r\":\"CausalImpact\"},\"needs_r_packages\":[\"CausalImpact\",\"bsts\"],\"runs_here\":false,\"summary\":\"Not built into the app yet. The authoritative version is the R package CausalImpact, which the Engines screen can install for you.\"},\"designs\":[{\"explain_key\":\"design.its\",\"id\":\"its\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"design\",\"one_liner\":\"Before versus after an interruption; maybe a control series.\",\"title\":\"A shock in a single series\"},{\"explain_key\":\"design.synth\",\"id\":\"synth\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"design\",\"one_liner\":\"One treated unit; build a comparison from a donor pool.\",\"title\":\"One place, constructed twin\"}],\"diagnostics\":[{\"explain_key\":\"diagnostic.its_series\",\"id\":\"its_series\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"diagnostic\",\"title\":\"The series and the interruption\"},{\"explain_key\":\"diagnostic.its_counterfactual\",\"id\":\"its_counterfactual\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"diagnostic\",\"title\":\"Counterfactual projection\"},{\"explain_key\":\"diagnostic.its_seasonality\",\"id\":\"its_seasonality\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"diagnostic\",\"title\":\"Seasonality\"},{\"explain_key\":\"diagnostic.its_autocorrelation\",\"id\":\"its_autocorrelation\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"diagnostic\",\"title\":\"Residual autocorrelation\"}],\"estimands\":[{\"acronym\":\"ATT\",\"explain_key\":\"estimand.att\",\"id\":\"ATT\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"estimand\",\"one_liner\":\"For people who actually got it, what did it do?\",\"title\":\"Average treatment effect on the treated\"}],\"explain_key\":\"method.its.causal_impact\",\"gaps\":[\"no plain-language description has been written yet, so the one-line summary is standing in for it\"],\"id\":\"its.causal_impact\",\"in_more_depth\":null,\"kind\":\"method\",\"needs_overlap\":false,\"one_liner\":\"Model the counterfactual series with a structural time-series model and control series, and report a posterior rather than an interval.\",\"options\":[],\"plain_language\":\"Model the counterfactual series with a structural time-series model and control series, and report a posterior rather than an interval.\",\"probes\":[{\"explain_key\":\"probe.placebo_treatment\",\"id\":\"probe.placebo_treatment\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"probe\",\"one_liner\":\"Move the policy date earlier, reshuffle who was treated, or swap in a variable that cannot cause the outcome.\",\"requested_as\":\"probe.placebo_treatment\",\"title\":\"Placebo treatment\"}],\"references\":[\"Brodersen et al. (2015), Inferring causal impact using Bayesian structural time-series\"],\"roles_forbidden\":[],\"roles_optional\":[],\"roles_required\":[\"an outcome\",\"a time variable\",\"an intervention time\"],\"see_also\":[{\"explain_key\":\"design.its\",\"id\":\"its\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"design\",\"one_liner\":\"Before versus after an interruption; maybe a control series.\",\"title\":\"A shock in a single series\"},{\"explain_key\":\"design.synth\",\"id\":\"synth\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"design\",\"one_liner\":\"One treated unit; build a comparison from a donor pool.\",\"title\":\"One place, constructed twin\"},{\"explain_key\":\"method.did.synthdid_r\",\"id\":\"did.synthdid_r\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"method\",\"one_liner\":\"Weight both units and periods, then take a difference-in-differences -- halfway between synthetic control and DiD.\",\"title\":\"Synthetic difference-in-differences (synthdid)\"},{\"explain_key\":\"method.its.arima\",\"id\":\"its.arima\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"method\",\"one_liner\":\"Model the memory in the series itself, then ask how big a step, pulse or ramp the data need at the intervention date.\",\"title\":\"ARIMA with an intervention\"},{\"explain_key\":\"method.its.controlled\",\"id\":\"its.controlled\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"method\",\"one_liner\":\"The same interruption, measured against a series the intervention did not touch, so a shock that hit everybody is not booked as your effect.\",\"title\":\"Controlled ITS\"},{\"explain_key\":\"method.its.segmented\",\"id\":\"its.segmented\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"method\",\"one_liner\":\"Fit the trend before the interruption, project it forward, and measure the jump and the change of direction after it.\",\"title\":\"Segmented regression\"},{\"explain_key\":\"method.sc.abadie\",\"id\":\"sc.abadie\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"method\",\"one_liner\":\"Build a weighted copy of the treated place out of untreated places that looked like it beforehand, then watch the two lines separate.\",\"title\":\"Synthetic control\"},{\"explain_key\":\"method.sc.augmented\",\"id\":\"sc.augmented\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"method\",\"one_liner\":\"When no weighted average of the donors can match the treated place, correct the leftover bias with a ridge model and show the size of the correction.\",\"title\":\"Augmented synthetic control\"}],\"status\":\"reasonable\",\"status_label\":\"Reasonable\",\"tags\":[\"A shock in a single series\",\"One place, constructed twin\",\"ATT\",\"Reasonable\"],\"title\":\"Bayesian structural time series (CausalImpact)\",\"what_it_assumes\":[{\"explain_key\":\"assumption.no_cointerventions\",\"explains\":\"Nothing else changed at the same moment that also moves the outcome.\",\"id\":\"no_cointerventions\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"assumption\",\"title\":\"No co-interventions at the interruption\",\"worry_when\":\"A busy policy period; a national event at the same date; a change in how the outcome was measured or coded at the same date.\"},{\"explain_key\":\"assumption.model_form\",\"explains\":\"The line you fit before the interruption is the line the outcome would have continued to follow.\",\"id\":\"model_form\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"assumption\",\"title\":\"Functional form of the counterfactual trend\",\"worry_when\":\"Few pre-period points; residual autocorrelation that survives the model; the estimate flips when you add a seasonal term or a quadratic trend.\"},{\"explain_key\":\"assumption.no_anticipation\",\"explains\":\"Units did not change behaviour before treatment arrived because they knew it was coming.\",\"id\":\"no_anticipation\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"assumption\",\"title\":\"No anticipation\",\"worry_when\":\"There was a public announcement well before the policy started, or the pre-period coefficients move in the period immediately before adoption.\"},{\"explain_key\":\"assumption.sutva\",\"explains\":\"One unit's treatment does not change another unit's outcome, and \\\"treated\\\" means the same thing for everyone who got it.\",\"id\":\"sutva\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"assumption\",\"title\":\"SUTVA / no interference\",\"worry_when\":\"Units interact: they compete for the same jobs, infect each other, share a classroom or a market. Or the \\\"programme\\\" is really a family of programmes whose intensity varied a lot across sites.\"},{\"explain_key\":\"assumption.donor_fit\",\"explains\":\"The weighted combination of untreated units reproduces the treated unit's pre-period path closely enough to stand in for it afterwards.\",\"id\":\"donor_fit\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"assumption\",\"title\":\"Pre-treatment fit from the donor pool\",\"worry_when\":\"Visible pre-period gaps; a short pre-period relative to the number of donors; one donor carrying most of the weight.\"},{\"explain_key\":\"assumption.convex_hull\",\"explains\":\"The treated unit's characteristics can be written as a weighted average of the donors', with weights that do not go negative.\",\"id\":\"convex_hull\",\"in_catalogue\":true,\"kind\":\"assumption\",\"title\":\"Treated unit inside the donor convex hull\",\"worry_when\":\"The treated unit is at an extreme of the donor distribution on the predictors, or the pre-period gap has a persistent level offset.\"}],\"when_not_to_use\":[\"The counterfactual is still a model. Priors matter, and control series that were themselves affected by the intervention quietly absorb the effect.\"],\"when_to_use\":[\"Handles trend, seasonality and control series in one model, and the posterior over the cumulative effect is easier to read than a sequence of coefficients.\"]},\"disposition\":\"imported\",\"gaps\":[\"no plain-language description has been written yet, so the one-line summary is standing in for it\"],\"id\":\"its.causal_impact\",\"kind\":\"method\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-inventory\"],\"raw_id\":\"its.causal_impact\",\"registry\":{\"coming\":\"Not wrapped. Segmented regression with HAC errors, seasonality and control series is implemented, as is an ARIMA intervention model.\",\"designs\":[\"its\",\"synth\"],\"diagnostics\":[\"its_series\",\"its_counterfactual\",\"its_seasonality\",\"its_autocorrelation\"],\"engine_support_basis\":\"Static adapter decorator and declared package metadata; installed availability not checked.\",\"engines\":{\"python\":false,\"r\":\"CausalImpact\"},\"estimands\":[\"ATT\"],\"id\":\"its.causal_impact\",\"one_liner\":\"Model the counterfactual series with a structural time-series model and control series, and report a posterior rather than an interval.\",\"probes\":[\"probe.placebo_treatment\"],\"r_needs\":[\"CausalImpact\",\"bsts\"],\"reference_dispositions\":[{\"disposition\":\"resolved_metadata\",\"id\":\"10.1214/14-aoas788\",\"requested_as\":\"Brodersen et al. (2015), Inferring causal impact using Bayesian structural time-series\"}],\"reference_ids\":[\"10.1214/14-aoas788\"],\"references\":[\"Brodersen et al. (2015), Inferring causal impact using Bayesian structural time-series\"],\"roles_required\":[\"outcome\",\"time\",\"event_time\"],\"source_path\":\"engines/registry/methods.extra.yaml\",\"source_sha256\":\"2cb349e9f7f7e6f88c10c18d81478656fd420eda7ca977d9767610ac8c7a4be0\",\"status\":\"reasonable\",\"title\":\"Bayesian structural time series (CausalImpact)\",\"what_can_go_wrong\":\"The counterfactual is still a model. Priors matter, and control series that were themselves affected by the intervention quietly absorb the effect.\",\"why_recommended\":\"Handles trend, seasonality and control series in one model, and the posterior over the cumulative effect is easier to read than a sequence of coefficients.\"},\"relations\":[{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[],\"counterevidence\":[],\"gaps\":[],\"id\":\"relation:00b1dc9c41a0636a53386ad9\",\"object_id\":\"assumption:no_anticipation\",\"predicate\":\"requires_assumption\",\"provenance\":[\"source:project-inventory\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"date\":\"2026-10-12\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"not_assessed\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Declared project registry/navigation relationship; not an identified causal effect.\",\"subject_id\":\"its.causal_impact\"},{\"assertion_mode\":\"editorial\",\"conditions\":[\"Interpret the relation within the stated design, population and observation process.\"],\"counterevide