declared target.\"],\"gaps\":[\"No audit result, diagnostic acceptance or human approval is implied.\"],\"id\":\"audit:heterogeneity-outcome\",\"method_ids\":[\"heterogeneity.continuous\",\"heterogeneity.binary\",\"heterogeneity.count\",\"heterogeneity.categorical\"],\"question\":\"Do outcome encoding, model link and marginal contrasts answer the same declared heterogeneity question, with exposure defined for rates?\",\"required_evidence\":[\"Outcome coding and exclusions\",\"Model matrix containing treatment, modifier main effects and interactions\",\"Conditional interaction and standardized marginal effects labeled separately\",\"Positive exposure and fixed log-offset when rate analysis is supported\",\"Robust covariance conditions, convergence and separation checks\",\"Category probability coding and independent contrast basis for joint tests\",\"Whether standardization uses actual subgroup rows or sets a continuous modifier on shared profiles\",\"Whether intervals condition on fixed profiles or account for their estimated distribution\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apache-2.0 project material; no third-party paper body included.\"},\"scope\":\"Methodological heterogeneity review; an actual finding requires authorized implementation and study evidence.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:ontology:statsmodels-glm\",\"source:ontology:knol2012\",\"source:ontology:statsmodels-mnlogit\"],\"title\":\"Match outcome family, scale and exposure\"},{\"concept_ids\":[\"concept:prespecified-modifier\",\"concept:heterogeneity-multiplicity\",\"concept:heterogeneity-support\"],\"conditions\":[\"Apply only to the implemented analysis and declared target.\"],\"gaps\":[\"No audit result, diagnostic acceptance or human approval is implied.\"],\"id\":\"audit:heterogeneity-prespecification\",\"method_ids\":[\"survival.kaplan_meier\",\"survival.rmst\",\"survival.aft\",\"ml.dml_plr\",\"ml.dml_irm\",\"ml.causal_forest\",\"ml.metalearner\",\"ml.policy_tree\",\"obs.tmle\",\"heterogeneity.continuous\",\"heterogeneity.binary\",\"heterogeneity.count\",\"heterogeneity.categorical\"],\"question\":\"Were modifier definitions and the hypothesis family fixed before outcome inspection, and are exploratory searches and pointwise intervals labeled?\",\"required_evidence\":[\"Baseline timing and protocol or analysis plan\",\"All tried modifiers, cut points, outcomes and horizons\",\"Multiplicity adjustment or explicit unadjusted exploratory reporting\",\"Within-subgroup treatment counts and support\",\"Holm or other adjustment family; adjusted p-values do not imply simultaneous confidence intervals\"],\"review\":{\"actor\":\"Codex agent\",\"actor_type\":\"agent\",\"basis\":[\"Original methodological explanation checked against linked primary sources; no independent human review or study audit.\"],\"date\":\"2026-10-14\",\"human_review\":false,\"semantic\":\"agent_editorial_context\",\"structural\":\"validated\"},\"rights\":{\"attribution\":\"Causal Capybara contributors; Yusufhan Balci; VCESR\",\"content_type\":\"original_project_content\",\"license_id\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"license_url\":\"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\",\"modified\":true,\"permissions\":{\"adapt\":true,\"cache\":true,\"display\":true,\"model_context\":true,\"public_export\":true},\"review_basis\":\"Original or imported Apac